Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libgssapi-krb5-2, libssl3t64 | libssl3 | libssl1.1, libicu76 | libicu74 | libicu72 | libicu71 | libicu70 | libicu67, libfontconfig1, libice6, libsm6, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxrandr2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Description: Manage Steam achievements and statistics
 Achievement Caretaker reads and writes achievements and statistics for
 the games in a Steam library. It shows the library with a completion meter per
 game, and opens a per-game editor for unlocking, locking and resetting.
 .
 It talks to the Steam client directly by loading steamclient.so in process, so
 the Steam client must be installed, running and logged in.
 .
 This package is self-contained: it bundles the .NET runtime and does not need
 dotnet-runtime-10.0 from Microsoft's repository.
 .
 Steam support is based on Steam Achievement Manager by Rick (gibbed), and is
 an altered source version of it. GOG support is based on GOG Achievements
 Manager by Timendum.
